{"asset_key":"ep2/quest_story_12232070","episode":"ep2","category":"quest_story","story_id":"12232070","schema_version":1,"lang":"cn","texts":{"say:2:1223207001:0":{"text":"喂！不就是弄丢了你的东西吗？叫嚷什么！","source_cn":"喂！不就是弄丢了你的东西吗？叫嚷什么！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x793A1DBCE5EF3DAE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1223207002:0":{"text":"大家快来看啊，水鬼耍赖了！","source_cn":"大家快来看啊，水鬼耍赖了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x783F257CB6F7CCA8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1223207003:1":{"text":"不仅弄丢了我的东西不赔钱，还威胁要打我！","source_cn":"不仅弄丢了我的东西不赔钱，还威胁要打我！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFE206F2A501559D5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1223207004:1":{"text":"谁让你的东西那么多，来回搬来搬去，丢了能怪我吗？","source_cn":"谁让你的东西那么多，来回搬来搬去，丢了能怪我吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB3148846E708DAE4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1223207005:1":{"text":"你……你！少废话，赔钱！不然我就找血薇帮来了！","source_cn":"你……你！少废话，赔钱！不然我就找血薇帮来了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x19D0F96C1D5CD93D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1223207